UPDATE companies SET description='Newtec Medical Equipment LLC operates from Toms River, New Jersey. The company was founded by Marc Gordon, a certified respiratory therapist (CRT) who began his career in 1985 delivering oxygen and medical equipment to home patients. After completing respiratory school in 1994, Gordon launched Newtec ME to address the gap left by declining insurance reimbursements that limited patient access to newer respiratory technologies.

The business retails a range of home respiratory devices, including portable oxygen concentrators, CPAP masks, nebulizers, and related oxygen supplies. A licensed respiratory therapist conducts in‑store demonstrations of portable concentrators, and the company offers a trade‑in program that allows customers to exchange a functional concentrator for a newer model. Prescription handling is streamlined through an online upload tool, and staff can coordinate directly with physicians to obtain required documentation.

Customer testimonials cite the Guardian 911 monitoring system and nebulizer products as examples of equipment supplied to home users.

