UPDATE companies SET description='Norwalk Apparel Co. operates from Norwalk, Connecticut, where it was founded by two passionate creatives with backgrounds in branding, apparel design, and small business growth. The founders launched the company to give other local businesses and organizations the tools to represent themselves with confidence and style, staying hands‑on with every order from design to final stitch.

