UPDATE companies SET description='O''Callaghan Cable Services, Inc. operates from Summerville, South Carolina, where it has provided telecommunication and cable construction services for more than three decades. The company began in South Carolina and has since expanded to execute projects nationwide, though no specific founding year or founder names are publicly disclosed.

