UPDATE companies SET description='OMG Tooling Inc. was founded in 1980 by Oliver Marino Gerardi in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma. Gerardi began by leasing a small space and operating a tool and die shop, sketching initial concepts on napkins before translating them into tooling and molds. The company expanded in 1992 when Gerardi purchased land and constructed its first dedicated building, establishing a foundation for full-service injection molding.

The company provides end-to-end plastic injection molding services, encompassing custom product design, in-house tooling fabrication, and molding production. OMG maintains internal tooling capabilities—including advanced tool building, tooling enhancements, and transfer tooling management—that many competitors have outsourced. Its engineering team automates molding processes to achieve consistent quality at competitive production rates, positioning the firm as a domestic alternative to overseas sourcing.

OMG serves original equipment manufacturers across a diverse set of sectors: consumer goods, healthcare, sports and leisure, construction, transportation, infrastructure, electronics, technology, and industrial markets. Customers frequently transfer existing molds to OMG for continued production, leveraging the shop’s expertise in tooling preservation and part quality improvement.

The company emphasizes its strategic location in central Oklahoma, which offers supply-chain advantages for U.S. distribution, and its commitment to ''Made in USA'' manufacturing. Founder Oliver Gerardi’s original values—integrity, excellence, quality, dedication, loyalty, and customer service—remain the stated guiding principles for the business.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom product design", "Tooling fabrication", "Plastic injection molding", "Transfer tooling management", "Advanced tool building", "Tooling enhancements", "Tooling life preservation", "Automated molding processes", "Design advisory for plastic materials", "Quality assurance"], "industries": ["Consumer Goods", "Healthcare", "Sports & Leisure", "Construction", "Transportation", "Infrastructure", "Electronics", "Technology", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Plastic materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house tooling design and fabrication capabilities", "Expertise in transfer tooling and tooling life preservation", "USA-based supply chain with central geographic location", "Automated molding processes for consistent quality", "Commitment to domestic manufacturing and intellectual property protection"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1980 by Oliver Marino Gerardi -> /about-us", "Started as tool and die shop in Oklahoma City -> /about-us", "Expanded 1992 with first building -> /about-us", "Full-service plastic injection molding for OEM manufacturers -> /", "Services: custom design, tooling fabrication, plastic product molding -> /", "In-house tooling capabilities including advanced tool building, enhancements, transfer tooling -> /", "Automated molding processes for consistent quality -> /", "Markets served: Consumer Goods, Healthcare, Sports & Leisure, Construction, Transportation, Infrastructure, Electronics, Technology, Industrial -> /", "Strategic USA supply chain location in Oklahoma City -> /", "Commitment to Ma