UPDATE companies SET description='OTHER Industries operates as a custom apparel production studio in Wilmington, Delaware. The business began in a basement where the founders printed shirts for their own clothing projects, gradually evolving into a full-scale production studio rooted in streetwear culture, graphic design, and independent music scenes.

The studio specializes in screen printing and embroidery, offering plastisol, water-based, and discharge inks along with specialty options such as puff, glow-in-the-dark, metallic, and high-density inks. It provides end-to-end services including garment sourcing, artwork preparation, digital proofing, sewing, finishing, folding, and packaging. Production is handled entirely in-house by experienced printers who manage screen setup, printing, and quality control. The shop focuses on bulk orders of 24 pieces or more and accommodates large-scale wholesale runs.

Clients span clothing brands, restaurants and coffee shops, construction and trade companies, schools and universities, corporate organizations, artists and bands, festivals and live events, nonprofits and community organizations, breweries and hospitality groups, and retail merchandise programs.

The founders chose the name OTHER Industries to signal a departure from traditional print shops, aiming to build a studio more connected to design, culture, and independent brands. They emphasize a hands-on, craft-oriented approach influenced by DIY printmaking communities in Philadelphia, with a dedicated sales representative for each order and a commitment to consistent, reliable production.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom screen printing", "Embroidery", "Promotional product decoration", "Wholesale apparel production", "Garment sourcing", "Artwork preparation and review", "Digital proof approval", "Quality control inspection", "Folding and packaging", "Plastisol ink printing", "Water-based ink printing", "Discharge ink printing", "Pantone color matching", "Specialty ink printing (puff, glow-in-the-dark, metallic, reflective, glitter, suede, plush, high-density, texture, stretch)", "Screen setup and production", "Sewing services", "Finishing services"], "industries": ["Clothing brands", "Restaurants & coffee shops", "Construction & trade companies", "Schools & universities", "Corporate organizations", "Artists & bands", "Festivals & live events", "Nonprofits & community organizations", "Breweries & hospitality groups", "Retail merchandise programs", "Marketing agencies", "Independent designers"], "materials": ["100% Cotton", "50/50 Cotton/Polyester blends", "Performance fabrics"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house production with no outsourced pipelines", "Dedicated sales representative per order", "Full-service capabilities: sourcing, decoration, finishing, sewing", "Specialty ink options including puff, glow-in-the-dark, metallic, reflective, glitter, suede, high-density", "Pantone color matching using Solid Coated and Uncoated books"], "facts_used": ["Location: Wilmington, Delaware -> db", "Founded in basement printing shirts for own projects -> /about", "Specializes in s