UPDATE companies SET description='The company does not publicly disclose its founding year or ownership structure, nor does it name its founders. It gained recognition in 2020 when MedTech Outlook named it one of the “Top 10 Contract Manufacturers.”

The firm specializes in contract manufacturing of orthopaedic implants and instruments. Its production capabilities include Chiron 5-axis mill/turn machining with a secondary collet pick-off system for continuous manufacturing, precision Swiss turning, and a quality system that encompasses risk management, process validation, inspection methods, and statistical controls. Inspection equipment includes a Keyence optical measurement system, a Brown & Sharpe coordinate measuring machine, and video and 3D comparators. The facility is ISO 13485:2016 certified and FDA registered for orthopaedic device manufacturing.

Odyssey serves the medical device industry, focusing on orthopaedics, spine, and trauma markets.

The company emphasizes its “Odyssey EDGE: Every Day Great Execution” philosophy, which drives continuous improvement in quality, efficiency, and cost reduction. It states that its unique workflow and quality control systems are designed to meet all specifications and exceed expectations, redefining the concept of close tolerances for medical implants.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485:2016','FDA Registered']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["5-Axis Mill/Turn Machining", "Precision Swiss Turn Manufacturing", "Quality Systems (Risk Management, Process Validation, Inspection Methods, Statistical Controls)", "Optical Measurement (Keyence)", "Coordinate Measuring Machine (Brown & Sharpe CMM)", "Video & 3D Comparators", "Contract Manufacturing of Orthopaedic Implants and Instruments"], "industries": ["Medical Device", "Orthopaedics", "Spine", "Trauma"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Chiron 5-Axis Mill/Turn", "Keyence Optical Measurement System", "Brown & Sharpe CMM", "Video & 3D Comparators"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Odyssey EDGE mantra for continuous quality, efficiency, and cost improvement", "ISO 13485:2016 certified and FDA registered for orthopaedic implants and instruments", "Comprehensive quality control systems specific to medical implant manufacturing", "Chiron 5-axis mill/turn with secondary collet pick-off for continuous manufacturing", "Precision Swiss turn manufacturing for accurate turning and milling"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Bartlett, Tennessee -> home page (address) and db (hq_city, hq_state_label)", "ISO 13485:2016 certified -> services page and db certifications", "FDA registered for orthopaedic implants and instruments -> services page", "Named MedTech Outlook Top 10 Contract Manufacturers 2020 -> home page", "Odyssey EDGE continuous improvement philosophy -> services page", "Chiron 5-axis mill/turn with secondary collet pick-off -> services page", "Precision Swiss turn manufacturing -> services page