UPDATE companies SET description='Ohio Metal Fabricating Inc. operates from Dayton, Ohio, where it has built over forty years of industry experience.

The shop specializes in metal spinning—both hand spinning and CNC metal spinning—as well as flat and three‑dimensional laser cutting. It can spin parts up to 104 inches in diameter with material thicknesses from 0.010 to 0.187 inches, holding tolerances as tight as 0.002 inches. In‑house capabilities extend to welding, penetrant inspection, punching, beading, anodizing, plating, painting, polishing, and custom assembly. Ninety‑nine percent of spinning tools and dies are produced internally, and secondary operations such as trimming, drilling, and flanging are performed in CNC cells equipped with a six‑axis laser and an M & M CNC lathe with full flanging and cutting functions.

The company serves a broad range of industries, though the source material does not name specific sectors. It works with engineers and quality teams from customer and supplier partners to reduce cost and shorten lead times on projects that range from prototypes to complex production components.

Ohio Metal Fabricating emphasizes a combination of quality, speed, and precision, citing an on‑time delivery record above 99 percent, competitive pricing, and short lead times. The firm also highlights its consulting on materials and finishing as a value‑added service that helps customers achieve a cost advantage over alternative fabrication methods.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Hand metal spinning", "CNC metal spinning", "Flat laser cutting", "3D laser cutting", "Welding", "Penetrant inspection", "Punching", "Beading", "Anodizing", "Plating", "Painting", "Polishing", "Custom assembly", "Tool and die making (in\u2011house)", "Secondary machining (trimming, drilling, flanging)", "Flanging", "Cutting"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": ["M & M CNC lathe with flanging and cutting capabilities", "Six\u2011axis laser cutting equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "\u00b10.002 in", "built_on": ["99% of spinning tools and dies made in\u2011house", "On\u2011time delivery rate above 99%", "Short lead times and competitive pricing", "Spinning capacity up to 104\u2033 diameter, 0.010\u2033\u20130.187\u2033 thickness, \u00b10.002\u2033 tolerance", "In\u2011house secondary operations (trimming, drilling, flanging) and finishing services"], "facts_used": ["Location: Dayton, Ohio -> db", "Over forty years of industry experience -> /", "Privately held, ownership not specified -> /", "Services: hand spinning, CNC metal spinning, flat and 3D laser cutting -> /about", "Spinning capacity: up to 104\u2033 diameter, 0.010\u2033\u20130.187\u2033 thickness, \u00b10.002\u2033 tolerance -> /about", "In\u2011house tooling: 99% of spinning tools and dies made in house -> /", "Secondary operations: beading, trimming, drilling, flanging -> /", "Finishing services: welding, penetrant inspection, punching, anodizing, plating, painting, polishing, custom assembly -> /about", "Equipment: six\u2011axis laser, M & M CNC lathe with flan