UPDATE companies SET description='Oklahoma Shirt Company operates from Oklahoma City, Oklahoma, where it was founded by a team passionate about design, craftsmanship, and Oklahoma culture. The shop began as a screen printing and apparel business focused on creating custom products that celebrate the people, businesses, and communities of the state.

